        "accordion_row_8MPEgw": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is blended learning? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Many of Study Active courses are delivered through blended learning, giving you the flexibility to study in a way that suits you. </p><p>You’ll complete your theory units online through a mix of engaging e-learning materials and live or recorded webinars. If your course includes practical elements, these are often covered in flexible, face-to-face workshops. </p><p>Throughout your course, you’ll have access to a rich library of interactive online content, available 24/7, allowing you to study anytime, anywhere, and at your own pace. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_TjHrjf": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I have to attend any sessions in person? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Most of your study can be completed online using our interactive resources. However, for courses that include practical components, you’ll need to attend practical workshops.</p><p>These workshops are designed to focus purely on hands-on skills and are scheduled at convenient times — usually weekends. They run monthly throughout the year, giving you plenty of flexibility to choose dates that fit your schedule.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_FGJLET": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are these courses nationally recognised? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! All Study Active qualifications are accredited by leading UK awarding bodies. </p><p>Our qualifications are also fully recognised by CIMSPA (Chartered Institute for the Management of Sport and Physical Activity), ensuring they are nationally respected across the fitness industry. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_EbhjnX": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any entry requirements?",
            "row_content": "<p> This depends on the specific course. Some courses require a minimum age or previous qualification while others are open to complete beginners. The entry requirements for each course are listed clearly on the course page so you know exactly where you stand.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
