          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can international students take your courses?",
            "row_content": "<p> Yes. If you have access to a computer and to a gym you can study most ofour online courses from anywhere in the world. This means you can train and achieve your qualification without needing to travel to the UK.The exception is for blended study courses with mandatory attendance dates. For these courses we list available dates before you enrol so you can plan with confidence.</p>"
