        "accordion_row_NqwNXM": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you support student visas? ",
            "row_content": "<p>We are unable to support any student visa applications. However, because most of our courses can be studied online, many learners overseas can still enrol and study without needing a visa.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_rhVxXK": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer funding options? ",
            "row_content": "<p> Yes. Study Active is proud to be an approved provider of ELCAS funding. This means we can offer many funded courses to serving members of the armed forces and veterans. Details on eligibility and how to apply can be found on our dedicated ELCAS page. If you believe you may be eligible please contact us so that we can guide, you through the process.</p>"
